      "uid": "6836be3b60b35b0012711330",
      "name": "Audience Insights",
      "description": "<p></p><p>Supercharge your content strategy with the Audience Insights app from Contentstack Marketplace! Seamlessly integrate your Lytics Customer Data Platform and gain precise audience data analysis directly within your <a href=\"https://www.contentstack.com/cms-guides/headless-cms\">headless CMS</a>.</p><p></p><p>The app understands how well your content resonates with target audiences by leveraging behavioral and demographic data. Deliver your messaging to the right audience segments and make strategic content decisions that drive engagement. Whether you are analyzing individual entries or exploring trends across pages, the Audience Insights app provides powerful insights to boost your content performance.</p><p></p><p>Once installed, you can effortlessly analyze audience data and enhance your personalization strategies.</p>",
      "icon": "https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt8f94ebff857fe1ae/blt52c9a686a3ba9ed3/68382027c2c2459356aef65d/Audience_Insights.svg",
